cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "GRACE-LoRA: specialise GRACE on a laptop with LoRA adapters, as an agent skill"
abstract: >-
  Adapts the GRACE foundation interatomic potential to organic molecules by training small
  per-element LoRA adapters on labels from the GRACE-OFF specialist, with DFT materials mixed in
  so accuracy on inorganic materials is kept. Runs on a laptop CPU; packaged as an agent skill
  that runs, validates and documents the optimisation loop.
authors:
